id: pm-rl-review107cubic
title: Triage the new Cubic review batch separately from PR 107 coverage
description: "Inventory of 33 new review threads arriving after the reported zero-open CodeRabbit round. The assigned coverage work remains on pm-rl-review107later. The batch includes runtime, test-harness, receipt and documentation claims; validation is pending unless a linked comment records concrete evidence."
type: Task
status: in_progress
priority: 1
